#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "Setting the installation prefix"
msgstr "Configurando o prefixo de instalação"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid "Installing in /opt/qt5"
msgstr "Instalando em /opt/qt5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:169
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The BLFS editors recommend installing <application>qt5</application> in a "
"directory other than <filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, i.e.  "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename>.  To do this, set the "
"following environment variable:"
msgstr ""
"Os(As) editores(as) do BLFS recomendam instalar o "
"<application>qt5</application> em um diretório diferente de <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, ou seja, <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> . Para fazer isso, configure a "
"seguinte variável de ambiente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:175
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>export QT5PREFIX=/opt/qt5</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>export QT5PREFIX=/opt/qt5</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:179
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the installation paths are hardcoded into installed files.  This "
"is the reason why <filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> is used "
"as installation prefix instead of <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/qt-&qt5-version;</filename>. To create a versioned "
"<application>qt5</application> directory after the installation is complete,"
" you may rename the directory and create a symlink:"
msgstr ""
"Ocasionalmente, os caminhos de instalação são rigidamente codificados nos "
"arquivos instalados. Essa é a razão pela qual <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> é usado como prefixo de instalação "
"em vez de <filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt-&qt5-version;</filename>. "
"Para criar um diretório versionado do <application>qt5</application> depois "
"que a instalação estiver completa, você pode renomear o diretório e criar um"
" link simbólico:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:187
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /opt/qt-&qt5-version;\n"
"ln -sfnv qt-&qt5-version; /opt/qt5</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /opt/qt-&qt5-version;\n"
"ln -sfnv qt-&qt5-version; /opt/qt5</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:191
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Later on, you may want to install other versions of "
"<application>qt5</application>. To do that, just remove the symlink and use "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> as the prefix again. Which"
" version of <application>qt5</application> you use depends only on where the"
" symlink points."
msgstr ""
"Mais tarde, você pode querer instalar outras versões do "
"<application>qt5</application>. Para fazer isso, apenas remova o link "
"simbólico e use <filename class=\"directory\">/opt/qt5</filename> como "
"prefixo novamente. Qual versão do <application>qt5</application> você usa "
"depende somente de onde o link simbólico aponta."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:202
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of qt5"
msgstr "Instalação do qt5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:206
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <application>qt5</application> is being reinstalled into the same "
"directory as an existing instance, run the commands done by <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, such as <command>make "
"install</command>, from a console or non-qt5 based window manager. It "
"overwrites <application>qt5</application> libraries that should not be in "
"use during the install process."
msgstr ""
"Se o <application>qt5</application> estiver sendo reinstalado no mesmo "
"diretório de uma instância existente, execute os comandos feitos por "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, como <command>make "
"install</command>, a partir de um console ou gerenciador de janelas não "
"baseado em qt5. Ele sobrescreve bibliotecas do "
"<application>qt5</application> que não deveriam estar em uso durante o "
"processo de instalação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><caution><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:217
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you did not install some of the recommended dependencies, examine "
"<command>./configure --help</command> output to check how to disable them or"
" use internal versions bundled in the source tarball."
msgstr ""
"Se você não instalou alguma das dependências recomendadas, examine a saída "
"gerada de <command>./configure --help</command> para verificar como "
"desabilitá-las ou usar versões internas incluídas no tarball do fonte."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:225
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The BLFS editors do not recommend installing <application>qt5</application> "
"into the <filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> hierarchy because it "
"becomes difficult to find components and to update to a new version.  If you"
" do want to install <application>qt5</application> in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, the directories need to be specified "
"explicitly.  In this case, set <envar>QT5PREFIX=/usr</envar> and add the "
"following to the configure arguments below:"
msgstr ""
"Os(As) editores(as) do BLFS não recomendam instalar o "
"<application>qt5</application> na hierarquia <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> porque se torna difícil encontrar "
"componentes e atualizar para uma nova versão. Se você efetivamente desejar "
"instalar o <application>qt5</application> em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, os diretórios precisam ser "
"especificados explicitamente. Nesse caso, configure "
"<envar>QT5PREFIX=/usr</envar> e adicione o seguinte aos argumentos de "
"configuração abaixo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:236
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>            -archdatadir    /usr/lib/qt5                \\\n"
"            -bindir         /usr/bin                    \\\n"
"            -plugindir      /usr/lib/qt5/plugins        \\\n"
"            -importdir      /usr/lib/qt5/imports        \\\n"
"            -headerdir      /usr/include/qt5            \\\n"
"            -datadir        /usr/share/qt5              \\\n"
"            -docdir         /usr/share/doc/qt5          \\\n"
"            -translationdir /usr/share/qt5/translations \\\n"
"            -examplesdir    /usr/share/doc/qt5/examples</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>            -archdatadir    /usr/lib/qt5                \\\n"
"            -bindir         /usr/bin                    \\\n"
"            -plugindir      /usr/lib/qt5/plugins        \\\n"
"            -importdir      /usr/lib/qt5/imports        \\\n"
"            -headerdir      /usr/include/qt5            \\\n"
"            -datadir        /usr/share/qt5              \\\n"
"            -docdir         /usr/share/doc/qt5          \\\n"
"            -translationdir /usr/share/qt5/translations \\\n"
"            -examplesdir    /usr/share/doc/qt5/examples</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:248
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now apply a patch to pull in the fixes curated by kde for those modules "
"which are required by packages mentioned in this book:"
msgstr ""
"Agora aplique um remendo para obter as correções selecionadas pelo KDE para "
"aqueles módulos que sejam exigidos pelos pacotes mencionados neste livro:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:252
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-kf5-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-kf5-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:255
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The patch is supposed to be used in a git repository. Otherwise some files "
"that should be modified by <command>configure</command> after applying the "
"patch are not touched. Fortunately, it is enough to create a <filename "
"class=\"directory\">.git</filename> directory in the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">qmake</filename> directory where the "
"<command>configure</command> script is run:"
msgstr ""
"Presume-se que o remendo seja usado em um repositório git. Caso contrário, "
"alguns arquivos que deveriam ser modificados pelo "
"<command>configure</command> depois de aplicar o remendo não seriam tocados."
" Felizmente, é suficiente criar um diretório <filename "
"class=\"directory\">.git</filename> no diretório <filename "
"class=\"directory\">qmake</filename> onde o conjunto de comandos sequenciais"
" <command>configure</command> for executado:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:263
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir -pv qtbase/.git</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir -pv qtbase/.git</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:266
#, xml-text
msgid "Fix a security vulnerability in qtbase:"
msgstr "Corrija uma vulnerabilidade de segurança no qtbase:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:269
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-security_fix-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../qt-everywhere-opensource-"
"src-&qt5-version;-security_fix-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:272
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"At this point we want to set up skipping most components.  Do that with:"
msgstr ""
"Neste ponto, queremos configurar o salto da maioria dos componentes. Faça "
"isso com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:275
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ls -Fd qt* | grep / | sed 's/^/-skip /;s@/@@' > tempconf &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i -r '/base|tools|x11extras|svg|declarative|wayland/d' tempconf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ls -Fd qt* | grep / | sed 's/^/-skip /;s@/@@' > tempconf &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i -r '/base|tools|x11extras|svg|declarative|wayland/d' tempconf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:279
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now, install <application>qt5</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, instale o <application>qt5</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:283
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure -prefix $QT5PREFIX   \\\n"
"            -sysconfdir /etc/xdg \\\n"
"            -confirm-license     \\\n"
"            -opensource          \\\n"
"            -dbus-linked         \\\n"
"            -openssl-linked      \\\n"
"            -system-harfbuzz     \\\n"
"            -system-sqlite       \\\n"
"            -nomake examples     \\\n"
"            -no-rpath            \\\n"
"            -syslog              \\\n"
"            $(cat tempconf)      \\\n"
"            &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure -prefix $QT5PREFIX   \\\n"
"            -sysconfdir /etc/xdg \\\n"
"            -confirm-license     \\\n"
"            -opensource          \\\n"
"            -dbus-linked         \\\n"
"            -openssl-linked      \\\n"
"            -system-harfbuzz     \\\n"
"            -system-sqlite       \\\n"
"            -nomake examples     \\\n"
"            -no-rpath            \\\n"
"            -syslog              \\\n"
"            $(cat tempconf)      \\\n"
"            &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:298
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure -prefix $QT5PREFIX   \\\n"
"            -sysconfdir /etc/xdg \\\n"
"            -confirm-license     \\\n"
"            -opensource          \\\n"
"            -dbus-linked         \\\n"
"            -openssl-linked      \\\n"
"            -system-harfbuzz     \\\n"
"            -system-sqlite       \\\n"
"            -nomake examples     \\\n"
"            -no-rpath            \\\n"
"            -journald            \\\n"
"            $(cat tempconf)      \\\n"
"            &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure -prefix $QT5PREFIX   \\\n"
"            -sysconfdir /etc/xdg \\\n"
"            -confirm-license     \\\n"
"            -opensource          \\\n"
"            -dbus-linked         \\\n"
"            -openssl-linked      \\\n"
"            -system-harfbuzz     \\\n"
"            -system-sqlite       \\\n"
"            -nomake examples     \\\n"
"            -no-rpath            \\\n"
"            -journald            \\\n"
"            $(cat tempconf)      \\\n"
"            &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:314
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:318
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:321
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:327
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Remove references to the build directory from installed library dependency "
"(prl) files by running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Remova referências para o diretório de construção dos arquivos de "
"dependência de biblioteca (prl) instalados executando o seguinte comando "
"como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:332
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>find $QT5PREFIX/ -name \\*.prl \\\n"
"   -exec sed -i -e '/^QMAKE_PRL_BUILD_DIR/d' {} \\;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>find $QT5PREFIX/ -name \\*.prl \\\n"
"   -exec sed -i -e '/^QMAKE_PRL_BUILD_DIR/d' {} \\;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:336
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install images and create the menu entries for installed applications.  The "
"<envar>QT5BINDIR</envar> variable is used here to point to the directory for"
" the executable programs.  If you have changed the bindir above, "
"<envar>QT5BINDIR</envar> will need to be adjusted below.  Be sure that the "
"<envar>QT5BINDIR</envar> variable is defined in root's environment and as "
"the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Instale imagens e crie entradas de menu para aplicativos instalados. A "
"variável <envar>QT5BINDIR</envar> é usada aqui para apontar para o diretório"
" dos aplicativos executáveis. Se você tiver mudado o bindir acima, "
"<envar>QT5BINDIR</envar> precisará ser ajustado abaixo. Certifique-se de que"
" a variável <envar>QT5BINDIR</envar> esteja definida no ambiente do(a) root "
"e como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:345
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>QT5BINDIR=$QT5PREFIX/bin\n"
"\n"
"install -v -dm755 /usr/share/pixmaps/                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/assistant/assistant/images/assistant-128.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/assistant-qt5.png &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/designer/src/designer/images/designer.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/designer-qt5.png  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/linguist/linguist/images/icons/linguist-128-32.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/linguist-qt5.png  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/qdbus/qdbusviewer/images/qdbusviewer-128.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/qdbusviewer-qt5.png &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -dm755 /usr/share/applications &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/assistant-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 Assistant\n"
"Comment=Shows Qt5 documentation and examples\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/assistant\n"
"Icon=assistant-qt5.png\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;Documentation;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/designer-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 Designer\n"
"GenericName=Interface Designer\n"
"Comment=Design GUIs for Qt5 applications\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/designer\n"
"Icon=designer-qt5.png\n"
"MimeType=application/x-designer;\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/linguist-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 Linguist\n"
"Comment=Add translations to Qt5 applications\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/linguist\n"
"Icon=linguist-qt5.png\n"
"MimeType=text/vnd.trolltech.linguist;application/x-linguist;\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/qdbusviewer-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 QDbusViewer\n"
"GenericName=D-Bus Debugger\n"
"Comment=Debug D-Bus applications\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/qdbusviewer\n"
"Icon=qdbusviewer-qt5.png\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;Debugger;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>QT5BINDIR=$QT5PREFIX/bin\n"
"\n"
"install -v -dm755 /usr/share/pixmaps/                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/assistant/assistant/images/assistant-128.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/assistant-qt5.png &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/designer/src/designer/images/designer.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/designer-qt5.png  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/linguist/linguist/images/icons/linguist-128-32.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/linguist-qt5.png  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -Dm644 qttools/src/qdbus/qdbusviewer/images/qdbusviewer-128.png \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/pixmaps/qdbusviewer-qt5.png &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -dm755 /usr/share/applications &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/assistant-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Assistente Qt5\n"
"Comment=Mostra documentação e exemplos do Qt5\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/assistant\n"
"Icon=assistant-qt5.png\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;Documentation;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/designer-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Projetista Qt5\n"
"GenericName=Projetista de Interface\n"
"Comment=Projetar GUIs para aplicativos Qt5\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/designer\n"
"Icon=designer-qt5.png\n"
"MimeType=application/x-designer;\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/linguist-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Linguista Qt5\n"
"Comment=Adicionar traduções a aplicativos Qt5\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/linguist\n"
"Icon=linguist-qt5.png\n"
"MimeType=text/vnd.trolltech.linguist;application/x-linguist;\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /usr/share/applications/qdbusviewer-qt5.desktop &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Qt5 QDbusViewer\n"
"GenericName=Depurador do D-Bus\n"
"Comment=Depurar aplicativos do D-Bus\n"
"Exec=$QT5BINDIR/qdbusviewer\n"
"Icon=qdbusviewer-qt5.png\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=Qt;Development;Debugger;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:416
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some packages such as <xref linkend='vlc'/> look for certain executables "
"with a -qt5 suffix.  Run the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user to create the necessary symlinks:"
msgstr ""
"Alguns pacotes, como <xref linkend='vlc'/>, procuram determinados "
"executáveis com um sufixo -qt5. Execute o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> para criar os "
"links simbólicos necessários:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:422
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>for file in moc uic rcc qmake lconvert lrelease lupdate; do\n"
"  ln -sfvn $QT5BINDIR/$file /usr/bin/$file-qt5\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>for file in moc uic rcc qmake lconvert lrelease lupdate; do\n"
"  ln -sfvn $QT5BINDIR/$file /usr/bin/$file-qt5\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:429
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:432
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-confirm-license</parameter>: Accept license without prompting "
"user during configuration."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-confirm-license</parameter>: Aceite a licença sem avisar o(a) "
"usuário(a) durante a configuração."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:437
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-opensource</parameter>: Install the opensource version of "
"<application>qt</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-opensource</parameter>: Instale a versão de fonte aberto do "
"<application>qt</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:442
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-nomake examples</parameter>: This switch disables building of "
"the example programs included in the source tarball. Remove it if you want "
"to build them."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-nomake examples</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a construção "
"dos programas de exemplo incluídos no tarball do fonte. Remova-a se quiser "
"construí-los."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:449
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-system-sqlite</parameter>: This switch enables use of the system"
" version of <application>SQLite</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-system-sqlite</parameter>: Essa chave habilita uso da versão do "
"sistema do <application>SQLite</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:454
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-system-harfbuzz</parameter>: This switch enables use of the "
"system version of <application>Harfbuzz</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-system-harfbuzz</parameter>: Essa chave habilita o uso da versão"
" do sistema do <application>Harfbuzz</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:459
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-dbus-linked</parameter> <parameter>-openssl-linked</parameter>: "
"These switches enable explicit linking of the "
"<application>D-Bus</application> and <application>OpenSSL</application> "
"libraries into <application>qt5</application> libraries instead of "
"<command>dlopen()</command>-ing them."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-dbus-linked</parameter> <parameter>-openssl-linked</parameter>: "
"Essas chaves habilitam vinculação explícita das bibliotecas do "
"<application>D-Bus</application> e do <application>OpenSSL</application> nas"
" bibliotecas do <application>qt5</application> em vez de abri-las com "
"<command>dlopen()</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:469
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-syslog</parameter>: This switch allows to send qt messages to "
"the <command>syslog</command> logging system."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-syslog</parameter>: Essa chave permite enviar mensagens qt para "
"o sistema de registro <command>syslog</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:474
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-journald</parameter>: This switch allows to send qt messages to "
"the <command>journald</command> logging system."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-journald</parameter>: Essa chave permite enviar mensagens qt "
"para o sistema de registro <command>journald</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:479
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>$(cat tempconf)</command>: This command provides a list of "
"components that should not be built. These entries are in the form of "
"\"-skip &lt;component&gt;\"."
msgstr ""
"<command>$(cat tempconf)</command>: Esse comando fornece uma lista de "
"componentes que não deveriam ser construídos. Essas entradas estão no "
"formato \"-skip &lt;componente&gt;\"."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:487
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring qt5"
msgstr "Configurando o qt5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:490
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:493
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref linkend=\"sudo\"/> is installed, QT5DIR should be available to the "
"super user as well. Execute the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se o <xref linkend=\"sudo\"/> estiver instalado, QT5DIR também deveria estar"
" disponível para o(a) superusuário(a). Execute os seguintes comandos como "
"o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:498
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sudoers.d/qt &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>Defaults env_keep += QT5DIR</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/sudoers.d/qt &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>Defaults env_keep += QT5DIR</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:502
#, xml-text
msgid "If you installed qt5 in /usr"
msgstr "Se você instalou qt5 em /usr"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:505
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you installed <application>qt5</application> in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, create an environment variable needed "
"by certain packages.  As the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou o <application>qt5</application> em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, crie uma variável de ambiente "
"necessária para certos pacotes. Como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:511
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh\n"
"\n"
"QT5DIR=/usr\n"
"export QT5DIR\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh\n"
"\n"
"QT5DIR=/usr\n"
"export QT5DIR\n"
"\n"
"# Termina /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:520
#, xml-text
msgid "If you did not install qt5 in /usr"
msgstr "Se você não instalou qt5 em /usr"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:523
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you installed <application>qt5</application> in a location other than "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, you need to update the "
"following configuration files so that <application>qt5</application> is "
"correctly found by other packages and system processes."
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou o <application>qt5</application> em um local diferente de "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, você precisa atualizar os "
"seguintes arquivos de configuração, de forma que o "
"<application>qt5</application> seja encontrado corretamente por outros "
"pacotes e processos do sistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:530
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, update the "
"<filename>/etc/ld.so.conf</filename> file and the dynamic linker's run-time "
"cache file:"
msgstr ""
"Como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, "
"atualize o arquivo <filename>/etc/ld.so.conf</filename> e o arquivo de cache"
" de tempo de execução do vinculador dinâmico:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:535
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/ld.so.conf &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal># Begin Qt addition\n"
"\n"
"/opt/qt5/lib\n"
"\n"
"# End Qt addition</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"ldconfig</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/ld.so.conf &lt;&lt; EOF\n"
"<literal># Inicia adição do Qt\n"
"\n"
"/opt/qt5/lib\n"
"\n"
"# Termina adição do Qt</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"ldconfig</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:546
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/ld.so.conf"
msgstr "/etc/ld.so.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:550
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, create the "
"<filename>/etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</filename> file:"
msgstr ""
"Como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, crie "
"o arquivo <filename>/etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</filename>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/qt5-alternate.xml:554
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/qt_5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/qt_5.sh\n"
"\n"
"QT5DIR=/opt/qt5\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/bin           PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/lib/pkgconfig PKG_CONFIG_PATH\n"
"\n"
"export QT5DIR\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/profile.d/qt_5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/qt_5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/qt_5.sh\n"
"\n"
"QT5DIR=/opt/qt5\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/bin           PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/lib/pkgconfig PKG_CONFIG_PATH\n"
"\n"
"export QT5DIR\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/profile.d/qt_5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

